OL,3,GNEWSAHousehold water bills set to
OL,4,Aincrease in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe average household water bill is set
OL,7,Fto go up by more than #30 next year.
OL,9,FJersey Water said households could
OL,10,Fexpect to pay an extra 8p per day from
OL,11,F1 January - equivalent to an additional
OL,12,F#2.55 per month.
OL,14,FIt comes as the company plans to invest
OL,15,F#26m upgrading its desalination plant,
OL,16,Fin a bid to increase output by up to
OL,17,F50% and strengthen the island's ability
OL,18,Fto "maintain water supplies during
OL,19,Fprolonged periods of low rainfall and
OL,20,Fdrought".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
