OL,3,GNEWSAHousehold water bills set to
OL,4,Aincrease in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelier Smith, chief executive officer
OL,7,Ffor Jersey Water, said the company had
OL,8,F"worked hard to keep customers' bills
OL,9,Fas low as possible" but said the
OL,10,Fincrease was necessary for "a resilient
OL,11,Fand secure water supply for the
OL,12,Ffuture".
